    "accessed_at": "2026-09-05T01:26:49.477786+00:00"
  },
  {
    "text": "OK nevermind, the team and Astra did a good job and our systems are more scalable than we anticipated.\n\nAstra is now rolled out to all Plus and Business users too. Hope you have a blast and let us know how it goes!",
    "created_at": "2026-09-04T22:30:29.000Z",
